### ATOMIC Backend - Manual API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Run `./gradlew bootRun` before executing these requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### -----------------------------------------
### Tasks
### -----------------------------------------

### [1] Get all tasks (empty on fresh start)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### [2] Create a new task (success)
# @name createdTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Design login screen",
  "description": "Create wireframe and implement Vue3 login component",
  "createdBy": "alice"
}

###

### [3] Create a second task
# @name secondTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Set up CI pipeline",
  "description": "Configure GitHub Actions for build and test",
  "createdBy": "bob"
}

###

### [4] Get all tasks (should now have 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### [5] Update task status — replace {taskId} with an id from response above
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "lastModifiedBy": "alice"
}

###

### [6] Update task status to COMPLETED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "lastModifiedBy": "bob"
}

###

### [7] Update task status to CANCELLED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "CANCELLED",
  "lastModifiedBy": "alice"
}

###

### [8] Delete a task — replace {taskId} with a real id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### -----------------------------------------
### Validation Error Cases
### -----------------------------------------

### [9] Create task — missing required title (expects 400 + fieldErrors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "No title provided",
  "createdBy": "alice"
}

###

### [10] Create task — missing createdBy (expects 400 + fieldErrors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Valid title but no createdBy"
}

###

### [11] Update status — missing lastModifiedBy (expects 400 + fieldErrors)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

###

### -----------------------------------------
### Not Found Cases
### -----------------------------------------

### [12] Update status on non-existent task (expects 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "lastModifiedBy": "alice"
}

###

### [13] Delete non-existent task (expects 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

###

### -----------------------------------------
### Vault / Infos
### -----------------------------------------

### [14] Get Vault info (returns fallback when Vault is not running)
GET {{baseUrl}}/infos
Accept: application/json

###

### -----------------------------------------
### Actuator
### -----------------------------------------

### [15] Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### [16] App info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

###
